  "title_zh": "一柄夜光",
  "title_en": "A Parasol of Night Light",
  "order": 30,
  "draft": false,
  "statement_zh": "天黑以后，纸伞成了唯一的灯。光从伞骨间漏下来，照见她，也照见夜色里那一点不肯散去的暖。",
  "statement_en": "After dark the paper parasol is the only lamp. Light falls through its ribs onto her, and onto the small warmth the night will not let go of.",
